  <!-- THE DESKTOP'S USER INTERFACE LIBRARY - what the desktop's programs draw their windows with (deskgui.h): the
       custom-drawn engine and its Luna theme, the forks of wx's generic controls and ours, the dock art, the code
       editor's host (univ\stc), the property grid (univ\propgrid), the docking, tool bar and notebook (univ\aui), the
       doc/view and its print preview (docview). Of the engine, the core alone; of wx, the core and the base. Scintilla and
       Lexilla are in src\3rdparty (a release copy and a submodule), built by univ\stc\scintilla and
       univ\stc\lexilla; their headers are on the include path. -->
